Assignment 4 : Online Movie Ticket Booking System
Create an Online Movie Ticket Booking System using JavaScript Promises and Promise Chaining.

Create a Promise named booking.
Use setTimeout() to simulate an asynchronous booking process.

Create a variable: let seatsAvailable = true;
If seats are available, use resolve(); otherwise, use reject().
Implement Promise Chaining using multiple .then() methods.

Your chain should follow this sequence:
1. Check Seat Availability
2. Process Payment
3. Confirm Booking
4. Generate Ticket
Pass the result from one .then() to the next using return.

Use .catch() to handle errors such as "No Seats Available."

Display all results in the Browser Console.
